theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "Move: A / D or Left / Right arrows
Jump: Space, W, or Up arrow
Attack: J or Right Ctrl
Pause: Escape

Pick up weapons by walking over them.
Weapons break with use — grab a new one!

TEAMS swap every 10-15 seconds.
Same color = allies (no damage).
Different color = enemies (score on kill).

Win by reaching the score target or having the most kills when time runs out."
autowrap_mode = 3

